# {{ project_name }}

{{ description }}

## Setup

From the workspace root:

```bash
uv sync --all-packages
```

## Plan and run

From the workspace root:

```bash
uv run research experiment plan \
  projects/{{ project_name }}/experiments/001_{{ experiment_slug }}.py \
  --spec {{ experiment_slug }}_spec
```

Review the planned batches before starting the runs:

```bash
uv run research experiment run \
  projects/{{ project_name }}/experiments/001_{{ experiment_slug }}.py \
  --spec {{ experiment_slug }}_spec
```
